{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Blue Grass Starters will instantly place a patch of ",["l","草","Blue Grass"]," when used on the ground. Over time, a patch of blue grass will grow and spread to surrounding tiles on the farm. Blue Grass can be harvested similarly to normal ",["l","草","Grass"]," with the ",["l","镰刀","Scythe"]," to produce ",["l","干草","Hay"],", once a ",["l","筒仓","Silo"]," is built. Blue Grass Starters can be planted in Winter, but they won't grow and spread to surrounding tiles."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Blue Grass Starter is not used in any ",["l","裁缝","tailoring"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a blue dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],". It can also be used as a blue dye when used in the spool of the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]]]}